00:08:45.760 --> 00:08:51.440
The issue is real, but appears manageable if the company applies the same focus it brings to

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:58.340
production and software updates. Addressing these pain points would strengthen loyalty as the fleet

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:05.240
